<title>USA: BBN extends timetable for profitability.</title>
<headline>BBN extends timetable for profitability.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BBN Corp said on Thursday that it extended the timetable for its goal of achieving EBITDA break-even beyond the fourth quarter of fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it expects investments to increase BBN Planet's operating loss in the third quarter.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
